{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03","cat":"bond","group":{"id":"char3002","label":"Neon"},"label":"Clues to the Legendary Gun","stage":null,"prev":"d_nikke_neon_02","next":"d_nikke_neon_04","speakers":{"maxwell":"Maxwell","neon":"Neon","anis":"Anis","rapi":"Rapi","ingrid":"Ingrid"},"icons":{"maxwell":"si_c102_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","ingrid":"si_c900_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_1","text":"There's a rumor going around the Ark, almost like an urban legend.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"NikkeRoom","bgArt":"nikkeroom","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_sundayintheark","movie":null,"shown":["maxwell","anis","rapi","neon"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_2","text":"They say there's a legendary gun out there, the only one of its kind...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_3","text":"A gun that can fire any kind of ammo and never malfunctions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_4","text":"Apparently, it can fly on its own and even repair itself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_5","text":"Oh...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_6","text":"Oh, please. This stopped being about guns a while ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_7","text":"The Senate feared that such immense power might fall into the hands of a single person, so they split the Legendary Gun into three pieces and sealed them in different places around the world.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_8","text":"In other words, you'll need to collect all three pieces to complete the Legendary Gun.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_9","text":"What's this, some kind of collect-the-pieces game? And what's the deal with this Senate?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_10","text":"Where are the parts, then?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_11","text":"There are some ancient documents detailing the location of the parts.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_12","text":"I've already deciphered them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_13","text":"I don't even feel like saying anything anymore.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_14","text":"Here. Take this, Neon, and see what you can find.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_15","text":"Wow, really?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_16","text":"Can I really have this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_17","text":"Of course, I'm giving it to you because it's you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_18","text":"Thank you!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_19","text":"Seriously? She's obviously messing with you. Why are you thanking her?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_20","text":"What makes you think that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_21","text":"It's obviously just a rumor. You'll only be wasting your time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_22","text":"It's not some rumor, and it's not a waste of time, either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_23","text":"Then why don't you just go get it yourself, huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_24","text":"Well... I don't exactly have time to spare.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:d_nikke_neon_03_25","text":"See? It's a scam. Just a waste of time.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_nikke_neon_03_26","type":"Speech","spea